! XRT-13 XE1(Catalyst 8000V 17.15)= PE。コアの IS-IS と LDP だけ。サービスは学ぶ側が設定する(BGP もまだ無い)。
! ★8000V は既定のライセンスの段階では MPLS が無い。構築の最後に xe_license.py が保存+再起動する(problem.yml の xe_license_boot)。
license boot level network-advantage addon dna-advantage
!
mpls label protocol ldp
mpls ldp router-id Loopback0 force
!
interface Loopback0
 ip address 10.255.0.41 255.255.255.255
 ip router isis CORE
!
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description CORE to P1
 ip address 10.0.41.41 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis CORE
 isis network point-to-point
 mpls ip
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[1] }}
 description to CE1 (customer D, site 1)
 no ip address
 no shutdown
!
router isis CORE
 net 49.0001.0100.0000.0041.00
 is-type level-2-only
 metric-style wide
 log-adjacency-changes
!
